Z||000005||fiero56||09-21-2000||03:24 PM||||Normal is 25-40 at 1000rpm, 45-55 at 2,000rpm. Minimum is 15 at 1,000rpm, 30 at 2,000rpm.<P>These measurements are for an engine thoroughly warmed up, and using the proper weight oil.<P>Here is my oil pressure at idle, note, this is a worn 2.8 with 165,000 miles, and a knocking rod:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Tof00002.jpg"> ||||reg||1
